<devicesets>
<deviceset name="WE-DPCHV_5030" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:14283418/2" prefix="L">
<description>WE-DPC HV SMT Dual Powerchoke

Characteristics
Our smallest double choke with 1.5kV isolation
Magnetical shielded
1:1 Transformer
Coupled miniature inductor with two identical windings
Operation temperature: -40 °C to +125 °C

Applications
High density Isolated converter application (i.e Flyback converter)
Buck, Boost, Sepic, Zeta, CUK Converter
Can be used as single inductor with series and parallel connection

Details see: www.we-online.com/components/products/WE-DPCHV

Updated by Ella 2026-09-16
2026 (C) Würth Elektronik</description>
